  "description": "Cross-platform alternative to System.Security.SecureString. Stores sensitive characters encrypted in memory (AES-GCM with a per-process key) and exposes them only briefly through an Access(...) callback. Inspired by Evolveum's GuardedString.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
